es that deaths from tetanus still occur because\nA. the bacteria is about to infect a person through the tiniest of wounds.\nB. infected people don't seek medical treatment early enough.\nC. not enough people are immunised against tetanus.", "sourcePage": 1, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 570, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-73f94dba7cbc46eb416d", "filename": "Listening Part C- Tetanus answers.docx", "sha256": "73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "\nWhy do some people believe the tetanus vaccine isn't necessary?\nA. Tetanus bacteria can't enter a person's bloodstream.\nB. Tetanus bacteria are everywhere, giving people natural immunity.\nC. Tetanus bacteria aren't affected by medication or vaccination.", "sourcePage": 1, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 858, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-73f94dba7cbc46eb416d", "filename": "Listening Part C- Tetanus answers.docx", "sha256": "73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "\nSally suggests the woman didn't understand the dangers of tetanus because\nA. she hasn't undergone a recent vaccination.\nB. she sought medical treatment very late.\nC. she ignored many early warning signs.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 0, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-73f94dba7cbc46eb416d", "filename": "Listening Part C- Tetanus answers.docx", "sha256": "73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "\nSally highlights the case of the 4-year-old boy to\nA. explain the symptoms of tetanus infection.\nB. show how tetanus can affect small children.\nC. illustrate how difficult it is to diagnose tetanus.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 243, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-73f94dba7cbc46eb416d", "filename": "Listening Part C- Tetanus answers.docx", "sha256": "73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "\nWhy does Sally believe the man's case highlights how everyone is at risk of tetanus?\nA. Because he arrived at hospital with no health complaints.\nB. Because the man had no injuries, but he still had tetanus.\nC. Because he couldn't remember when he was immunised.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 481, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-73f94dba7cbc46eb416d", "filename": "Listening Part C- Tetanus answers.docx", "sha256": "73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-1cb6b2807fb8752e1430", "filename": "Listening Part C- Sochi Winter Olympics answers.docx", "sha256": "1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, {"id": "offline-73f94dba7cbc46eb416d", "filename": "Listening Part C- Tetanus answers.docx", "sha256": "73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}], "passages": []}, {"id": "8e8f3e56ee13871e-p3", "label": "Part C · Listening Part C: Sochi Winter Olympics", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "8e8f3e56ee13871e2f3f29f12dee6a75fe9c0534645ea23427b944603cf81bc4", "pages": [3, 4], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "\nDr Mene suggests that her role as CMO required her to\nA. use a range of care options to assist athletic performance.\nB. work longer hours than usual to manage all the injuries.\nC. exercise sympathy because it was busy for everyone.", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 360, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-1cb6b2807fb8752e1430", "filename": "Listening Part C- Sochi Winter Olympics answers.docx", "sha256": "1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "\nDr Mene says the medical support of athletes\nA. was tailored to the specific needs of the individual.\nB. was the same as treating patients at a medical clinic.\nC. depended on the type of health care provider available.", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 631, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-1cb6b2807fb8752e1430", "filename": "Listening Part C- Sochi Winter Olympics answers.docx", "sha256": "1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "\nWhat is Dr Mene's view on providing care for life-threatening injuries?\nA. A level of team work would have ensured a positive outcome.\nB. They knew there wouldn't be any to attend at the Olympics.\nC. If they had occurred, flexible treatment would have been required.", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 889, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-1cb6b2807fb8752e1430", "filename": "Listening Part C- Sochi Winter Olympics answers.docx", "sha256": "1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "\nDr Mene says her team prevented injuries by\nA. reducing the amount of competition and travel for each athlete.\nB. evaluating what athletes ate and what they did after competing.\nC. having more advanced technology than other competing nations.", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 0, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-1cb6b2807fb8752e1430", "filename": "Listening Part C- Sochi Winter Olympics answers.docx", "sha256": "1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "\nDr Mene was impressed with he software they used because\nA. it was particularly useful for musculoskeletal injuries.\nB. it had tremendous communication potential.\nC. it can help in critical care situations.", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 282, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-1cb6b2807fb8752e1430", "filename": "Listening Part C- Sochi Winter Olympics answers.docx", "sha256": "1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "\nDr Mene thinks any physician wanting to treat athletes at a major sporting event should\nA. understand that you won't make a lot of money doing it.\nB. apply what they learn at these events to their private practice.\nC. take the time to forge connections that enhance your reputation.", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 528, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-1cb6b2807fb8752e1430", "filename": "Listening Part C- Sochi Winter Olympics answers.docx", "sha256": "1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-1cb6b2807fb8752e1430", "filename": "Listening Part C- Sochi Winter Olympics answers.docx", "sha256": "1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1cb6b2807fb8752e143064e46a3a5c115f24886bc81ce8e9ee9aaa1f45c7b416.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, {"id": "offline-73f94dba7cbc46eb416d", "filename": "Listening Part C- Tetanus answers.docx", "sha256": "73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0ba2fba0b679588ea9889b7bb9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/73f94dba7cbc46eb416dc175796a98138ddd7e0